(E/'session-state.md').write_text('Review complete: REVISE. review-result.json contains eight checks and one restriction finding. All 11 observed source banks replay; canonical full-row-rank stem rejected by all profiles. Fresh math: 220 records, seven controls, five exact batch records. Native grader: 45 accepts/180 rejects. Actual UI: 12 screenshots inspected. Five batch records survive delivery. Inventory: 13 examined, two historical generated records reproduced, one old ordering weakness retained in affected-inventory.json. Package unchanged per full-file hash comparison.\n')
